{
 "name": "air_ghost",
 "title": "Air Ghost - desk CO2 / temperature / humidity monitor, SCD40, USB-C",
 "revision": "A",
 "brief": "A ghost-shaped desk air monitor on USB-C. A Sensirion SCD40 (photoacoustic CO2 400-2000 ppm plus temperature and humidity, I2C, 5 V) is read every 5 s by a CH32V003 running from VBUS, which sets the colour of two WS2812C-2020 cheeks: green under 800 ppm through yellow and orange to red above 2000. The tactile button is the ghost's 'O' mouth: boop for temperature and humidity colours, hold for night mode. 2 layers, single-sided SMT, white mask, black silk, ENIG.",
